# Keyword pre-filter for the llm filter — recall-first:
# over-accept and let the LLM resolve topicality on the shortlist.
# Calibrated 2026-10-30 against all 3131 trusted stored PASS verdicts:
# 7 misses (0.22%), accepted minority loss. Gate FAILs are recomputed live and never
# cached, so editing this list never invalidates stored LLM verdicts.

